# =========================
# FastF1 caches (NOT version-controlled)
# =========================
# /.fastf1_cache/ is the runtime HTTP cache. /data/raw/fastf1_cache/ holds
# reproducible .ff1pkl session blobs (removed from the index in R7; the
# baseline commit retains them historically). Both stay local-only so the
# working tree runs offline; neither belongs in Git or Git LFS.
# Processed datasets (data/processed, data/interim) remain tracked.
/.fastf1_cache/
/data/raw/fastf1_cache/

# =========================
# Temporary files
# =========================
*.tmp
*.bak
*.swp
*~

# =========================
# Intentional artifacts (do NOT ignore)
# =========================
# data/processed, data/interim (but NOT data/raw/fastf1_cache/),
# results/models, results subdirectories and
# tests/fixtures/legacy_predictions.json are part of the
# R0 baseline and must remain tracked. Do not add *.pkl,
# *.csv or data/ exclusions here without an artifact-policy
# update in docs/V2_REPOSITORY_AUDIT.md.